  THE ARMING was read where it names nothing: it is the arming of the obligation an expression sits in the HENCE or LEST of, and this one was evaluated where no obligation had that position. One of: it was defined at the top level (a top-level rule's WHERE, or a function's body) and used there, where no obligation has been entered; it was passed in a value attached under a LEST, whose join never fired (THE JOIN), or under an obligation with no WITHIN (THE DEADLINE); or this is the HENCE of a barrier whose cast was EMPTY, so nobody had a deadline (THE DEADLINE). Read it inside the HENCE or LEST whose position it means, and pass it to a function as an argument from there.
